subject: fix(vercel-deploy): add AbortSignal.timeout to all fetch calls (GAP-P2-23)

Add configurable timeout budgets to prevent deploy operations from
hanging indefinitely on stuck Vercel API responses:

- VERCEL_API_TIMEOUT_MS (60s): deploy creation + project PATCH
- VERCEL_POLL_TIMEOUT_MS (30s): per-poll fetch in pollDeployment loop
- RELAY_FORWARD_TIMEOUT_MS (60s): edge relay proxy forwarding

All 3 handler fetches (deploy create, project PATCH, pollDeployment)
now pass AbortSignal.timeout(). The relay function code deployed to
Vercel Edge also receives AbortSignal.timeout via template interpolation.

Unit test suite: 5 tests covering signal presence on each fetch call,
abort propagation, and relay code source verification. Anti-false-
positive check: confirmed test catches broken assertions.

